---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Anti-Money Laundering - CloudDroid" description="CloudDroid AML/CFT policy and compliance statement for payment processors and due diligence.">
  <div class="bg-slate-light py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-navy mb-4">Anti-Money Laundering (AML) & Counter-Terrorist Financing (CFT)</h1>
      <p class="text-slate text-lg">Our commitment to preventing financial crime and compliance with applicable AML/CFT regulations.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-12">

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy mb-4">1. Policy Statement</h2>
        <p class="text-slate mb-4">CloudDroid is committed to combating money laundering, terrorist financing, and other financial crimes. We maintain a risk-based AML/CFT program designed to detect, prevent, and report suspicious activities in compliance with applicable laws and regulations.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy mb-4">2. Customer Identification</h2>
        <p class="text-slate mb-4">We verify the identity of our customers at onboarding. This includes:</p>
        <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-5">
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-slate space-y-2">
            <li>Collection of accurate name, email, and contact information</li>
            <li>Verification of email address through account activation</li>
            <li>Collection of IP address and user agent for fraud prevention</li>
            <li>Verification of payment method ownership through payment processor checks</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy mb-4">3. Prohibited Activities</h2>
        <p class="text-slate mb-4">The following activities are strictly prohibited and may result in immediate account termination:</p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-5">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-navy mb-2">Money Laundering</h3>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-sm text-slate space-y-1">
              <li>Using services to conceal proceeds of crime</li>
              <li>Structuring transactions to avoid reporting thresholds</li>
              <li>Using false identities or stolen payment methods</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-5">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-navy mb-2">Terrorist Financing</h3>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-sm text-slate space-y-1">
              <li>Providing services to sanctioned individuals or entities</li>
              <li>Facilitating transactions for terrorist organizations</li>
              <li>Using services to move funds for illegal purposes</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-5">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-navy mb-2">Sanctions Evasion</h3>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-sm text-slate space-y-1">
              <li>Doing business with sanctioned countries or regions</li>
              <li>Using VPNs or proxies to circumvent geographic restrictions</li>
              <li>Providing false information about location or identity</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-5">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-navy mb-2">Fraud</h3>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-sm text-slate space-y-1">
              <li>Card testing or payment fraud</li>
              <li>Identity theft or impersonation</li>
              <li>Using stolen or fraudulent payment methods</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy mb-4">4. Monitoring and Detection</h2>
        <p class="text-slate mb-4">We employ automated monitoring systems to detect suspicious activities, including:</p>
        <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-5">
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-slate space-y-2">
            <li>Unusual transaction patterns or volumes</li>
            <li>Multiple accounts from the same IP address or device</li>
            <li>Rapid account creation and cancellation cycles</li>
            <li>Geographic anomalies in account activity</li>
            <li>Payment method verification failures</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy mb-4">5. Reporting Obligations</h2>
        <p class="text-slate mb-4">We cooperate fully with law enforcement and regulatory authorities. We will report suspicious activities to the appropriate authorities as required by applicable law. We also cooperate with payment processors on fraud and AML investigations.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy mb-4">6. Record Keeping</h2>
        <p class="text-slate mb-4">We maintain records of customer identification, transactions, and due diligence checks for a minimum of 5 years, or as required by applicable law, to support AML/CFT compliance and investigations.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy mb-4">7. Contact</h2>
        <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-5">
          <p class="text-slate">For AML/CFT compliance inquiries or to report suspicious activity, please contact us at:</p>
          <p class="text-slate mt-2">CloudDroid<br>RUNESTONE HANDLUNG s.r.o.<br>Soukenická 877/9<br>Ostrava, 702 00<br>Czech Republic<br>IČO: 23389702<br><a href="mailto:support@clouddroid.eu" class="text-navy underline">support@clouddroid.eu</a></p>
        </div>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
